What this repository contains
-----------------------------

Tools, documentation, and translations of the game's text into other languages.

What it deliberately does not contain
-------------------------------------

Any part of the game: no executable, no data containers, no artwork, no fonts,
no audio, and **not one line of the original script**, in English or in
Japanese. Translations are stored as a key plus a fingerprint of the source
string, never the source string itself (docs/specs/SPEC-005-translation-keys.md).
Translated artwork is either text that this project draws itself on an empty
canvas, or the difference against an image that only you have
(docs/specs/SPEC-003-image-delta.md).

The tools read the game from *your own legally obtained copy*, on your own
machine, and write a mod or a set of patched files that only works if you already
have that copy. Nothing is uploaded anywhere.

The Android build re-signs the app with a key made on your machine and, unless you
ask it not to (`--keep-license-check`), switches off the Google Play licence check
inside the copy it is patching, because a re-signed copy cannot pass it. That is a
change to a file of your own copy, it is documented (docs/ANDROID.md,
docs/specs/SPEC-012-license-check.md), and it is meant for an app you bought.

Do not ask this project for game files, and do not open issues or pull requests
that include them, including screenshots of the original script.
